WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.420 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 3]

01:49.070 --> 01:49.980
This is the first

01:50.000 --> 01:51.540
of those three hidden weapons,

01:52.480 --> 01:53.820
Cries of 1,000 Birds!

02:18.710 --> 02:19.340
Yu.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.660
What are you up to again?

02:27.560 --> 02:28.570
Do you truly intend to kill me?

02:29.590 --> 02:30.570
The same bewitching spell

02:31.240 --> 02:31.940
won't work

02:32.030 --> 02:32.820
on me again.

02:33.800 --> 02:34.780
Tell me the motive

02:34.840 --> 02:35.660
of your Patriarch,

02:36.240 --> 02:37.010
and I'll spare you.

02:37.630 --> 02:38.410
I told you before.

02:38.870 --> 02:40.100
I don't know any bewitching spells.

02:43.750 --> 02:45.340
If you actually had feelings for me,

02:50.030 --> 02:51.290
that means you've fallen for me.

02:57.680 --> 02:58.130
Demoness,

02:58.870 --> 02:59.500
do not spout such nonsense!

03:00.080 --> 03:00.570
Wait!

03:02.590 --> 03:03.820
Can you use another hidden weapon instead?

03:04.430 --> 03:05.010
What do you mean?

03:06.280 --> 03:07.570
I'll be pricked by all these needles.

03:07.960 --> 03:09.260
I'll meet an ugly end, you know?

03:11.590 --> 03:12.570
Can you use something else

03:13.870 --> 03:15.220
that won't let me meet an ugly end?

03:15.680 --> 03:16.130
Or use something

03:17.400 --> 03:18.450
that can let me die while preserving my looks?

03:26.150 --> 03:26.780
What is this?

03:27.430 --> 03:28.380
This is the Blood Rose.

03:28.910 --> 03:29.570
Although

03:29.590 --> 03:30.660
it might look silver to you,

03:31.400 --> 03:32.130
once it penetrates

03:32.190 --> 03:33.130
your body,

03:33.910 --> 03:35.380
your blood will flow into its petals,

03:35.910 --> 03:37.290
dyeing it red.

03:38.030 --> 03:38.690
It'll form a beautiful rose.

03:54.120 --> 03:56.010
So, you're the leader of the Blood River Spider Shadow Sect,

03:56.400 --> 03:56.890
Kui.

03:57.400 --> 03:58.100
How's your injury?

03:58.630 --> 03:59.890
I would've died for real

04:00.240 --> 04:01.380
had you come a few moments later.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.890
Trap him with the 1000-Spider Array.

04:12.030 --> 04:12.850
I suppose I have to see

04:12.910 --> 04:13.850
the rest of your hidden weapons next time.

04:21.680 --> 04:22.100
Yu,

04:22.510 --> 04:24.140
the Tracking Spider that you owned

04:24.160 --> 04:25.220
started getting excited all of a sudden.

04:25.510 --> 04:27.100
I knew that you would be near.

04:27.390 --> 04:28.410
Luckily, you made it in time.

04:28.630 --> 04:29.410
Is your injury okay?

04:30.430 --> 04:31.100
It's nothing too serious.

04:32.190 --> 04:33.170
Tang Lianyue

04:33.630 --> 04:34.410
went easy on me.

04:35.040 --> 04:35.490
If not,

04:36.240 --> 04:37.490
I might've been dead.

04:38.270 --> 04:38.850
After all,

04:39.920 --> 04:41.460
he's one of the Four Guardians of Tianqi City.

04:41.920 --> 04:43.460
He's a top martial arts expert.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.490
Luckily, he's the one you encountered.

04:49.510 --> 04:50.850
Tang Lianyue, the Xuanwu Guardian,

04:51.560 --> 04:53.370
always hated killing.

04:54.480 --> 04:55.050
Nonsense.

04:56.430 --> 04:57.490
He spared me

04:57.720 --> 04:58.730
because

04:58.750 --> 04:59.610
he fell for me at first glance.

05:01.680 --> 05:02.290
Your blind confidence

05:02.310 --> 05:03.540
is actually growing stronger.

05:06.000 --> 05:06.580
I'm serious.

05:07.390 --> 05:08.810
Just now, he said

05:09.160 --> 05:10.610
that I cast a bewitching spell on him.

05:11.270 --> 05:11.730
Yu,

05:12.560 --> 05:13.580
do you think I know any bewitching spells?

05:14.480 --> 05:16.250
Most of the women in the Mu family excel at bewitching spells.

05:17.510 --> 05:18.780
However, I suppose you don't know any.

05:22.160 --> 05:23.610
The Xuanwu Guardian targeted me because he fell for me.

05:24.480 --> 05:25.660
I must be charming, then.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.410
Let's drop the topic for now.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.140
Changhe sent many people

05:29.160 --> 05:30.410
to obstruct me while I was on my way here.

05:31.190 --> 05:31.980
He knew all about

05:32.040 --> 05:32.780
our movements.

05:33.120 --> 05:34.660
He even delivered a message to Tang Lianyue.

05:35.510 --> 05:36.340
That means he has planted a mole

05:36.360 --> 05:37.050
within Spider Shadow.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.170
We have to return to the Patriarch

05:39.240 --> 05:39.980
as soon as possible.

05:41.430 --> 05:41.930
Yu.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.580
Has it never occurred to you

05:46.160 --> 05:46.980
that I might be

05:48.870 --> 05:49.660
the mole?

05:51.950 --> 05:53.050
That's not funny.

05:54.070 --> 05:54.930
I'm not joking.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.810
I did hesitate before.

05:59.870 --> 06:00.540
Although

06:01.920 --> 06:02.900
I haven't managed

06:03.600 --> 06:04.290
to do something

06:04.310 --> 06:05.900
that will go against the vow I made back then,

06:07.240 --> 06:07.930
Yu,

06:09.950 --> 06:10.610
I hesitated.

06:12.310 --> 06:13.220
I'm starting to doubt

06:14.120 --> 06:15.220
the meaning of our existence.

06:19.190 --> 06:19.700
Yu.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.290
You grew up together

06:21.430 --> 06:22.700
with Changhe.

06:24.070 --> 06:24.980
But this time,

06:27.040 --> 06:28.050
do you two have to

06:28.070 --> 06:28.660
fight each other?

06:30.600 --> 06:32.140
I swore a vow when I joined Spider Shadow.

06:33.600 --> 06:34.460
I won't let anyone

06:36.240 --> 06:37.340
threaten the Patriarch's safety

06:37.430 --> 06:38.900
until the day I die.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.170
Of course I remember that.

06:42.630 --> 06:43.490
Joining the Spider Shadow

06:44.600 --> 06:46.290
is the biggest honor for a member of Blood River.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.730
Once the Patriarch's poison is neutralized,

06:50.040 --> 06:51.410
and he rules over the Three Families again,

06:52.430 --> 06:54.050
the head of the Su family will rescind his order.

06:55.360 --> 06:55.930
By then,

06:57.000 --> 06:57.730
we won't need to

06:57.800 --> 06:58.660
go against each other.

07:22.510 --> 07:23.610
Who's there?

07:24.360 --> 07:24.900
I'm Su Muyu

07:25.510 --> 07:26.140
of the Su family.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.410
Why are you here?

07:29.720 --> 07:30.290
I cannot

07:30.920 --> 07:31.730
accept this mission.

07:36.430 --> 07:37.290
It's been many years

07:37.310 --> 07:38.250
since anyone dared

07:38.720 --> 07:40.540
to reject the mission

07:40.560 --> 07:41.370
the Soul Reapers' Hall had assigned.

07:41.800 --> 07:42.610
Even the Patriarch

07:42.680 --> 07:44.340
cannot change our decision.

07:45.240 --> 07:45.780
What's your excuse

07:46.270 --> 07:47.730
for rejecting us?

07:48.390 --> 07:49.250
I don't feel like accepting it.

07:50.070 --> 07:51.610
That's not your decision to make.

07:52.630 --> 07:54.100
But I know why you're doing so.

07:54.630 --> 07:56.140
Zhang Taicheng, the Governor of Luonan,

07:56.750 --> 07:57.610
was rumored

07:57.680 --> 07:59.100
to be an excellent official who loved his people.

07:59.830 --> 08:00.980
When the south was struck by a flood,

08:01.120 --> 08:01.610
every prefecture

08:01.630 --> 08:02.980
lined their pockets.

08:03.680 --> 08:04.610
He was the only one who opened the granaries

08:04.920 --> 08:05.980
to aid the people.

08:06.430 --> 08:07.290
Not only that,

08:07.800 --> 08:09.020
but he also reported their corruption

08:09.040 --> 08:10.100
to Tianqi City,

08:10.190 --> 08:11.140
forcing Tianqi City

08:11.190 --> 08:12.220
to send their inspectors here.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.780
That's how the people were able to survive.

08:15.160 --> 08:16.220
He's a good person.

08:16.800 --> 08:17.250
Therefore,

08:18.070 --> 08:19.340
you don't wish to kill him.

08:20.310 --> 08:20.980
Such audacity!

08:22.190 --> 08:23.700
Once you receive the writ of the Soul Reapers' Hall,

08:24.390 --> 08:25.850
you have to kill your target, even if he's the emperor.

08:26.830 --> 08:28.100
Whether he's good or bad doesn't matter.

08:28.750 --> 08:29.580
You're an assassin.

08:29.950 --> 08:30.810
You aren't a saint.

08:32.000 --> 08:32.730
I won't accept it.

08:40.150 --> 08:41.610
Relay a message to the head of the Su family.

08:42.030 --> 08:43.010
Deem him a traitor.

08:43.670 --> 08:44.340
Kill him.

08:45.030 --> 08:46.130
Kill him!

08:46.960 --> 08:48.340
If the old fool of the Su family isn't willing to kill him,

08:49.200 --> 08:49.650
I'll do it.

08:50.150 --> 08:51.490
Calm down.

08:51.750 --> 08:52.180
Look.

08:52.870 --> 08:54.650
One of his friends has arrived.

08:58.960 --> 08:59.890
Greetings, Three Officials.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.580
Su Changhe,

09:02.320 --> 09:03.770
also known as the Undertaker.

09:04.360 --> 09:06.060
The rising prodigy of the Su family.

09:06.790 --> 09:08.300
You stand shoulder to shoulder with Su Muyu.

09:08.510 --> 09:09.300
Shoulder to shoulder?

09:11.030 --> 09:12.650
That means I'm inferior to him.

09:13.840 --> 09:15.220
What are you doing here?

09:15.600 --> 09:16.980
Su Muyu is a great buddy of mine.

09:17.790 --> 09:18.940
He wanted to set a rule

09:19.240 --> 09:20.610
for the Soul Reapers' Hall about how he would accept missions.

09:21.630 --> 09:23.370
My buddy has a set of rules called the Three Refusals.

09:24.200 --> 09:25.460
He refuses to accept missions of massacre,

09:26.320 --> 09:27.580
missions without cause,

09:28.200 --> 09:29.460
and missions against his will.

09:32.390 --> 09:33.580
And I, Su Changhe,

09:34.440 --> 09:35.730
wish to set a rule too.

09:38.000 --> 09:38.650
You two

09:38.670 --> 09:40.250
are still green.

09:40.840 --> 09:42.890
You think you can set up a rule here?

09:44.200 --> 09:46.340
Even the Patriarch doesn't have the right to do so.

09:47.870 --> 09:48.650
It seems

09:49.120 --> 09:50.340
the Soul Reapers' Hall

09:51.150 --> 09:53.130
must keep you guys in check today.

09:55.600 --> 09:56.650
The other two officials, please wait.

09:57.510 --> 09:58.940
I wish to hear about

09:59.550 --> 10:00.370
the kind of rule

10:01.150 --> 10:02.340
you wish to set.

10:03.150 --> 10:04.460
This is the rule I wish to set.

10:05.360 --> 10:07.300
For the missions that Su Muyu wouldn't accept,

10:08.150 --> 10:09.060
I'll accept them all.

10:24.600 --> 10:26.130
You went to the Soul Reapers' Hall a few days ago.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.100
Why did you go there?

10:30.080 --> 10:31.610
Of course I went there to negotiate a deal on your behalf.

10:32.910 --> 10:33.980
You're bad with your words.

10:34.550 --> 10:36.100
The Soul Reapers' Hall isn't the Patriarch.

10:36.360 --> 10:37.250
They only acknowledge the rules.

10:37.960 --> 10:38.850
They don't care about the sword you wield.

10:40.360 --> 10:41.700
No wonder it's as if they've acknowledged

10:41.790 --> 10:42.730
the three rules I set.

10:43.720 --> 10:44.580
Naturally.

10:45.240 --> 10:47.010
I've always been eloquent, you know?

10:49.790 --> 10:51.300
If they don't yield, you'll beat them until they do.

10:51.840 --> 10:52.530
If that's the case,

10:53.240 --> 10:54.580
I suppose you're eloquent in your own way.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.490
Don't tell me

10:59.550 --> 11:00.180
you actually fought them.

11:02.000 --> 11:02.770
I merely analyzed

11:02.910 --> 11:04.250
the pros and cons for them.

11:04.870 --> 11:06.580
The Soul Reapers' Hall keeps tabs too, you know?

11:06.910 --> 11:07.580
Killing you

11:07.750 --> 11:08.770
doesn't benefit them in any way.

11:13.750 --> 11:14.490
Be honest with me.

11:15.630 --> 11:16.610
Did you agree

11:16.670 --> 11:17.300
to some of their conditions?

11:20.080 --> 11:20.980
You have your own means.

11:21.080 --> 11:21.850
I have my own means as well.

11:24.600 --> 11:25.300
Just trust me.

11:31.620 --> 11:39.300
[Jiuxiao City]

11:41.780 --> 11:44.460
[Jiuxiao City]

11:45.360 --> 11:46.770
"My sword shatters the nine heavens,

11:46.770 --> 11:48.150
[Li Hanyi, Xueyue City]

11:48.150 --> 11:48.980
[Li Hanyi, Xueyue City]
severing all chaos.

11:48.980 --> 11:50.750
[Li Hanyi, Xueyue City]

11:50.750 --> 11:51.650
[Li Hanyi, Xueyue City]
It cuts through sorrow

12:09.030 --> 12:10.530
and strikes down every injustice,

12:11.320 --> 12:12.770
so that I can soar with you beyond the mortal sky."

12:12.960 --> 12:14.370
Is this the city

12:14.440 --> 12:15.850
where the Sword Poet Deity made a name for himself?

12:19.120 --> 12:21.130
His strike pierces through the nine heavens, huh?

12:21.720 --> 12:22.980
That's just a rumor.

12:26.630 --> 12:27.180
Sir.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.010
You're a swordsman too.

12:29.600 --> 12:30.770
Haven't you thought of visiting Jiuxiao City

12:31.080 --> 12:32.770
when you were young?

12:33.960 --> 12:35.420
Ordinary people see swords as mere swords.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.180
For Blood River, swords

12:38.120 --> 12:38.980
are weapons for murder.

12:40.670 --> 12:41.530
Moreover,

12:42.270 --> 12:43.130
I wasn't a swordsman

12:43.150 --> 12:44.010
when I was young.

12:45.150 --> 12:45.770
I picked up swordsmanship

12:46.440 --> 12:47.530
after that.

12:47.960 --> 12:48.580
Sir,

12:49.120 --> 12:50.250
what did people call you

12:50.480 --> 12:51.010
when you were young?

12:56.120 --> 12:57.010
Do you know

12:57.480 --> 12:59.100
that the question you asked just now

12:59.150 --> 13:01.180
was a taboo in Blood River?

13:08.320 --> 13:08.980
However,

13:10.030 --> 13:11.940
I think it won't matter even if I tell you my name.

13:12.910 --> 13:13.530
My surname is Mu.

13:14.480 --> 13:16.010
They called me Mu Mingce

13:17.030 --> 13:18.250
before I became the Patriarch.

13:20.240 --> 13:22.300
Mu Mingce?

13:29.630 --> 13:32.650
Is this the so-called Spider's Nest?

13:34.750 --> 13:35.650
The Spider Shadow Sect

13:35.790 --> 13:37.220
has set up such bases

13:38.000 --> 13:39.580
in both Beili and Nanjue.

13:40.240 --> 13:40.940
Each base

13:41.670 --> 13:43.890
is a fortress that's easy to defend and hard to invade.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.530
Therefore, many people

13:48.630 --> 13:49.610
don't want us

13:50.390 --> 13:52.460
to return to our nest.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.340
That's all you got, huh?

14:17.080 --> 14:18.460
You think that you can deal with me?

14:18.720 --> 14:19.650
It's from the Xie family.

14:20.000 --> 14:20.530
Chou the Ox,

14:21.390 --> 14:22.220
there's no need to expose them.

14:22.910 --> 14:23.460
Sir,

14:23.790 --> 14:25.010
since they were bold enough to attack us,

14:25.510 --> 14:26.100
there's no need

14:26.120 --> 14:27.340
for us to spare them.

14:27.630 --> 14:28.420
Let's kill them all.

14:34.120 --> 14:35.610
The Xie family and the Mu family actually joined hands?

14:56.550 --> 14:58.460
They actually set up the Heavenly Web Array!

15:01.440 --> 15:02.010
Heavenly Web Array?

15:03.440 --> 15:03.850
Don't look!

15:08.480 --> 15:08.890
Hai the Swine!

15:09.240 --> 15:09.700
Chou the Ox?

15:10.480 --> 15:11.130
I'm not dead yet.

15:11.870 --> 15:12.370
Sir,

15:12.750 --> 15:13.460
didn't you say

15:13.480 --> 15:14.890
that this carriage was impenetrable?

15:15.200 --> 15:15.820
Why aren't we using it?

15:16.270 --> 15:17.100
It's too late.

15:18.080 --> 15:19.220
He has already infiltrated it.

15:19.600 --> 15:20.180
He?

15:24.600 --> 15:26.460
Fanhua, it's you.

15:26.820 --> 15:29.030
[Xie Fanhua, young master of the Xie family]

15:29.030 --> 15:30.420
[Xie Fanhua, young master of the Xie family]
Long time no see.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.340
Sir,

15:33.030 --> 15:34.820
please pardon me for not being able to greet you

15:36.000 --> 15:37.530
as I'm quite sick.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.250
Sickly Ghost?

15:41.000 --> 15:42.700
You're terminally ill.

15:43.000 --> 15:43.770
Even the deities can't save you.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.370
Indeed.

15:47.150 --> 15:49.340
I'm destined to die soon.

15:49.960 --> 15:51.130
That's why I'm daring enough

15:51.240 --> 15:53.940
to intercept the Patriarch's carriage and see him personally.

15:54.670 --> 15:55.850
I'm not afraid of

15:56.600 --> 15:57.460
the punishment that awaits me.

15:59.840 --> 16:00.890
So,

16:02.750 --> 16:04.580
what are you trying to tell me here?

16:06.910 --> 16:07.610
Sir,

16:08.480 --> 16:09.610
you've been in this position

16:10.440 --> 16:11.530
for a long time.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.180
And now,

16:14.550 --> 16:15.770
you're seriously wounded.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.340
Why don't you use this opportunity to retire

16:18.750 --> 16:19.850
and enjoy the rest of your years?

16:20.080 --> 16:22.980
Isn't it better to leave this vexing position

16:23.510 --> 16:25.850
to those who are in the prime

16:26.550 --> 16:27.700
of their youth?

16:30.750 --> 16:32.130
In the prime of their youth?

16:32.750 --> 16:33.580
Are you referring

16:34.630 --> 16:35.490
to Xie Ba?

16:39.670 --> 16:41.300
The head of the Xie family

16:42.550 --> 16:43.370
has served Blood River faithfully

16:44.000 --> 16:46.060
all these years.

16:47.550 --> 16:48.130
Naturally,

16:48.480 --> 16:50.100
he's the best candidate for the position.

16:52.440 --> 16:54.730
What if I reject your request?

16:57.270 --> 16:58.300
If so,

16:59.200 --> 17:00.580
I have no choice but to offend you.

17:17.310 --> 17:18.420
You guys merely

17:19.350 --> 17:20.220
desire

17:20.350 --> 17:21.180
the Dormant Dragon Sword

17:21.240 --> 17:22.380
that I possess.

17:24.480 --> 17:26.010
The one who wields the Dormant Dragon Sword

17:27.270 --> 17:29.490
is the true leader of Blood River.

17:30.240 --> 17:31.620
So, you know about that, huh?

17:32.590 --> 17:34.090
If so, I suppose you can see

17:34.680 --> 17:35.330
who the current wielder

17:35.400 --> 17:37.220
of the sword is.

17:41.240 --> 17:42.380
Since I still wield

17:42.680 --> 17:43.770
the sword,

17:44.920 --> 17:46.330
I'm still the leader

17:47.640 --> 17:49.090
of Blood River.

17:59.920 --> 18:00.620
The Soul-Calling Incense?

18:03.270 --> 18:03.730
Senior Brother!

18:07.310 --> 18:07.700
This is bad.

18:08.310 --> 18:09.860
He protected the incense with his inner force.

18:13.160 --> 18:13.620
Sir!

18:14.160 --> 18:14.900
The Patriarch is fine.

18:20.590 --> 18:21.180
Let's leave.

18:26.480 --> 18:27.770
It's impossible for Xie Fanhua

18:28.400 --> 18:29.980
to get his hands on the Soul-Calling Incense.

18:31.790 --> 18:33.420
The Mu family must've given it to him.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.180
The Soul-Calling Incense

18:37.350 --> 18:38.420
isn't that difficult to neutralize.

18:39.510 --> 18:40.490
But this is truly unexpected.

18:40.720 --> 18:42.250
Sir, you came from the Mu family.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.050
But now,

18:44.510 --> 18:46.490
even the Mu family is disregarding their past ties with you.

18:47.720 --> 18:48.810
Once a person becomes the Patriarch,

18:50.400 --> 18:52.220
they will cease to be a member of the Three Families.

19:01.350 --> 19:01.980
Sir,

19:02.590 --> 19:03.330
I never expected

19:03.400 --> 19:04.460
your inner force to be this powerful.

19:04.720 --> 19:06.250
You actually expelled the poison

19:06.310 --> 19:06.900
by force.

19:07.270 --> 19:08.330
That's the easy part.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.940
However, I can't utilize my power

19:12.160 --> 19:14.290
for the next 24 hours.

19:36.620 --> 19:39.070
[Mu Kewen, Spider's Nest]

19:39.070 --> 19:40.180
[Mu Kewen, Spider's Nest]
Sir.

19:43.070 --> 19:43.700
Ke.

19:45.240 --> 19:46.180
How long

19:46.960 --> 19:47.660
have you served the sect?

19:48.920 --> 19:50.460
It's been 30 years.

19:51.640 --> 19:53.140
I never thought I'd live to see the day

19:53.510 --> 19:55.530
when the Patriarch himself would come.

19:57.070 --> 19:58.380
I have no regrets in life now.

20:01.880 --> 20:04.330
You should've spent your retirement years here in peace.

20:05.680 --> 20:06.570
I've caused trouble for you

20:07.680 --> 20:08.860
by coming here.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.290
Sorry for bothering you.

20:11.350 --> 20:12.860
Sir, you must be joking.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.940
People like us

20:15.550 --> 20:17.140
have no right

20:17.480 --> 20:19.010
to retire.

20:20.880 --> 20:21.860
All of you, listen up.

20:22.550 --> 20:24.050
Utter no word the moment

20:25.160 --> 20:26.010
you step through the gate.

20:29.000 --> 20:29.490
Understood.

20:30.750 --> 20:31.620
Sir,

20:32.440 --> 20:33.180
the key.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.810
You all may speak now.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.010
Is that the Soundless Array?

22:26.400 --> 22:26.980
Indeed.

22:27.590 --> 22:30.250
That's the Soundless Array.

23:04.550 --> 23:05.220
Sir,

23:05.680 --> 23:07.460
let me take you to your room.

23:16.480 --> 23:17.140
Sir,

23:18.400 --> 23:19.660
who's this lady?

23:21.110 --> 23:22.180
I'm Bai Hehuai.

23:22.680 --> 23:23.940
I could've treated your hunched back

23:24.310 --> 23:25.460
had you encountered me 50 years earlier.

23:27.640 --> 23:28.250
This lady

23:28.270 --> 23:29.460
is the miracle physician of the Medicine King Valley.

23:30.400 --> 23:31.050
She might not be bragging

23:31.440 --> 23:32.620
with what she said.

23:33.270 --> 23:34.490
I never brag.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.810
He wasn't born

23:36.070 --> 23:36.810
with a hunched back.

23:37.110 --> 23:38.860
It was because someone poisoned him.

23:39.640 --> 23:40.810
His bones turned soft because of it.

23:40.960 --> 23:41.730
That's why his back is hunched.

23:44.750 --> 23:46.250
If the poison was neutralized in time,

23:46.590 --> 23:48.220
and if he received some chiropractic treatments,

23:48.440 --> 23:49.180
his condition could've been cured.

23:52.160 --> 23:53.010
It's a shame

23:54.400 --> 23:56.290
that it's been too long since then.

23:59.200 --> 24:00.090
Thank you, miracle physician.

24:00.920 --> 24:01.570
I'm already

24:02.070 --> 24:03.250
used to it.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.180
It's not that I cannot cure your condition.

24:05.510 --> 24:06.420
But the price

24:08.110 --> 24:08.700
will be steep.

24:09.480 --> 24:10.010
How steep?

24:16.070 --> 24:17.330
Why don't you give me the entire residence?

24:21.000 --> 24:21.730
Sir,

24:22.270 --> 24:24.140
the miracle physician must be joking.

24:27.110 --> 24:27.900
Miracle physician,

24:28.270 --> 24:29.980
you're quite greedy, aren't you?

24:30.790 --> 24:32.140
That's why I left the Medicine King Valley.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.050
Sir,

24:34.750 --> 24:36.490
we've arrived at your room.

24:36.880 --> 24:37.420
Miracle physician,

24:38.200 --> 24:39.770
if you encounter any issues,

24:40.590 --> 24:43.050
just tug this rope.

24:43.880 --> 24:46.570
The wooden bird will relay the sound through vibration.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.050
And,

24:48.920 --> 24:50.330
I'll rush to your side

24:50.510 --> 24:51.490
as fast as I can.

24:52.160 --> 24:52.700
The wooden bird?

24:53.270 --> 24:53.660
That's right.

24:54.480 --> 24:55.420
Wooden birds can be found

24:56.030 --> 24:58.420
in every corner of the Spider's Nest.

24:59.350 --> 25:00.010
Sir,

25:01.160 --> 25:02.220
I shall take my leave first.

25:39.270 --> 25:39.810
Sir.

25:47.750 --> 25:49.220
You're a stubborn old man.

25:50.270 --> 25:51.420
I haven't fainted yet.

25:52.750 --> 25:55.380
Miracle physician, you don't need to mock me first.

25:56.110 --> 25:57.010
I just think

25:57.240 --> 25:58.530
that the old man

25:58.590 --> 25:59.570
was loyal to you.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.530
If so, why did you still pretend

26:01.590 --> 26:02.290
to be tough

26:02.510 --> 26:03.420
and acted as if

26:03.440 --> 26:04.570
you were still normal?

26:04.680 --> 26:06.660
You would understand why

26:08.000 --> 26:09.090
if you saw the face he had when he killed people.

26:11.350 --> 26:12.660
I do trust him.

26:13.720 --> 26:14.570
But it's been 30 years

26:15.880 --> 26:17.900
since we met after all.

26:19.440 --> 26:20.290
It's truly exhausting

26:20.590 --> 26:21.180
to be the Patriarch.

26:48.510 --> 26:49.050
He's on our tails.

26:52.350 --> 26:53.010
I'll stop him.

26:53.350 --> 26:54.050
You can head to Jiuxiao City.

26:54.590 --> 26:55.380
We're talking about Tang Lianyue here.

26:56.160 --> 26:56.940
He might have spared you last time.

26:57.590 --> 26:58.420
But he might not this time.

26:59.550 --> 26:59.980
Yu,

27:00.640 --> 27:01.090
I don't want to choose

27:01.200 --> 27:02.380
between you and Changhe.

27:03.240 --> 27:04.180
Go and end this once and for all.

27:05.310 --> 27:06.420
You can decide for me.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.530
As for him...

27:10.960 --> 27:11.460
Just trust me.

27:12.200 --> 27:12.980
He can't bear to kill me.

27:18.160 --> 27:19.460
I'll give you some of my Life-Protecting zhenqi.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.090
Escape if you can't stop him.

27:31.160 --> 27:31.770
Please be careful.

27:45.960 --> 27:46.980
You're hot on our tails, aren't you?

27:47.440 --> 27:47.940
We've been traveling

27:47.960 --> 27:48.940
day and night without rest.

27:49.030 --> 27:49.980
Even so, you still caught up to us.

27:50.830 --> 27:51.220
What's wrong?

27:51.680 --> 27:52.570
Do you wish to see me

27:52.590 --> 27:53.290
that badly?

27:53.550 --> 27:55.050
You two can't travel fast due to the carriage.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.700
Of course I can catch up to you two.

27:57.550 --> 27:58.180
Did Umbrella Ghost

27:58.750 --> 27:59.660
leave you behind?

28:00.510 --> 28:01.090
That's right.

28:01.510 --> 28:02.620
You see, other people

28:02.880 --> 28:03.940
don't treat me that nicely.

28:04.000 --> 28:04.810
Unlike you, Xuanwu Guardian.

28:05.720 --> 28:07.420
I still remember

28:07.790 --> 28:09.090
your warm embrace last night.

28:09.790 --> 28:11.140
You have a warm body.

28:11.510 --> 28:12.530
Why are you pretending

28:12.640 --> 28:13.660
to be a cold person?

28:13.830 --> 28:14.090
You!

28:20.270 --> 28:21.770
Do you actually think that I won't kill you?

28:22.240 --> 28:22.900
Of course not.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.180
The martial world is never short of passionate men.

28:25.720 --> 28:26.250
However,

28:26.920 --> 28:28.180
they always lose their passion

28:28.590 --> 28:29.570
soon after.

28:30.070 --> 28:30.620
Although

28:30.720 --> 28:32.220
you may have fallen for me that night,

28:32.790 --> 28:34.620
you might have forgotten about me the next day.

28:35.720 --> 28:36.700
Or perhaps,

28:37.400 --> 28:39.140
seeking vengeance is more important to you.

28:39.750 --> 28:41.420
Perhaps a relationship isn't as important to you.

28:43.400 --> 28:44.010
Who knows?

28:44.640 --> 28:45.570
Who said I fell for you?

28:45.720 --> 28:46.770
I wonder who's flustered here.

28:50.030 --> 28:52.220
Although my beauty is unparalleled,

28:52.880 --> 28:54.290
and I'm the top beauty of Blood River,

28:55.110 --> 28:55.700
you and I

28:57.400 --> 28:59.250
are just fleeting acquaintances.

28:59.880 --> 29:00.770
It's a transient love affair.

29:01.960 --> 29:03.290
You might think that you have fallen for me at first glance,

29:03.960 --> 29:05.090
but you're just after my body.

29:05.790 --> 29:06.810
In the end, you have no deep feelings

29:06.830 --> 29:07.730
for me.

29:09.070 --> 29:09.490
I understand.

29:11.110 --> 29:12.530
I'm just after your body?

29:15.440 --> 29:15.860
Stop right there.

29:17.660 --> 29:20.060
[Luojiuxiao Inn]

29:59.270 --> 30:01.700
Try to kill me, and I'll try to kill you.

30:02.640 --> 30:05.570
Til death do us part...

30:20.440 --> 30:20.810
Remember,

30:21.920 --> 30:22.460
I'm not killing you

30:23.240 --> 30:24.460
only because I don't like to kill.

30:40.160 --> 30:41.220
I knew you were lying to me.

30:48.070 --> 30:49.490
I knew you were still concerned about me.

30:58.110 --> 30:59.330
Your hidden weapons are terrifying.

31:00.550 --> 31:01.530
I'm no match for you.

31:02.830 --> 31:03.460
This time...

31:05.720 --> 31:06.770
This time,

31:07.920 --> 31:08.940
I might actually die.

31:31.270 --> 31:31.810
You won't die today.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.620
Miracle physician,

32:18.310 --> 32:20.420
will you perform the Soul-Swap Technique on me today?

32:20.790 --> 32:21.810
I'm afraid I can't perform it today.

32:22.240 --> 32:22.900
Sir,

32:22.960 --> 32:24.420
you had just gone through a huge battle this morning.

32:24.920 --> 32:26.220
You're still mentally weakened.

32:27.070 --> 32:28.530
The Soul-Swap Technique

32:28.750 --> 32:30.180
will exhaust a large portion of

32:30.440 --> 32:31.980
the target's and the caster's mental strength.

32:32.750 --> 32:33.380
If we perform

32:33.440 --> 32:35.140
the Soul-Swap Technique now,

32:35.960 --> 32:36.730
I'm afraid

32:36.790 --> 32:37.490
our lives will be in danger.

32:39.240 --> 32:40.140
Sir,

32:40.440 --> 32:41.530
you should rest for today.

32:42.830 --> 32:43.860
As long as

32:44.790 --> 32:45.770
the Spider's Nest

32:45.830 --> 32:47.380
is as impenetrable as you said,

32:48.070 --> 32:49.330
there's nothing to worry about.

32:53.440 --> 32:54.010
Fine.

32:55.110 --> 32:57.570
I suppose we can wait a little longer.

32:57.860 --> 33:00.060
[Shuying Villa]

33:07.750 --> 33:10.220
The moon looks gorgeous tonight.

33:10.880 --> 33:11.490
Yeah.

33:12.310 --> 33:14.770
It does look gorgeous.

33:15.510 --> 33:15.900
Who's there?

33:28.830 --> 33:29.660
The Phantom Step, huh?

33:30.030 --> 33:31.290
That's the technique of Blood River's Su family.

33:31.510 --> 33:32.250
You were mistaken.

33:32.640 --> 33:33.860
I just dodged your skill casually.

33:34.030 --> 33:34.860
This is interesting.

33:35.510 --> 33:36.140
The girl I thought

33:36.160 --> 33:37.460
I could kill with one blow

33:37.790 --> 33:39.290
has given me a huge surprise.

33:39.880 --> 33:40.570
That's not

33:41.110 --> 33:41.770
the only surprise you'll see.

33:43.880 --> 33:45.140
This is no fun.

33:45.400 --> 33:46.250
You should remove the straw hat.

33:46.680 --> 33:47.330
You can't see well after all.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.940
The Su family's Three-needle Thread, huh?

34:06.350 --> 34:07.900
That's a technique that many Celestial Assassins

34:07.920 --> 34:09.130
cannot master.

34:09.480 --> 34:10.010
You'd better not move.

34:10.480 --> 34:11.340
If not, I'll kill you.

34:11.840 --> 34:13.170
I can no longer move.

34:14.190 --> 34:15.490
Just deal one more blow to me,

34:16.070 --> 34:16.780
and I'll die for sure.

34:17.360 --> 34:18.570
Do you think I'm that dumb?

34:18.960 --> 34:20.210
Who knows what kind of tricks you're up to?

34:22.110 --> 34:22.690
Someone!

34:32.110 --> 34:33.690
If you encounter any issues,

34:34.110 --> 34:34.820
just

34:35.230 --> 34:36.610
tug this rope.

34:37.070 --> 34:37.900
The wooden bird

34:38.110 --> 34:39.780
will relay the sound through vibration.

34:40.550 --> 34:41.210
And I'll rush to your side

34:41.440 --> 34:43.940
as fast as I can.

35:01.860 --> 35:05.300
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:05.310 --> 35:09.250
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:11.140 --> 35:14.560
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:14.570 --> 35:18.970
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:20.700 --> 35:23.910
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:24.190 --> 35:26.210
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:26.260 --> 35:29.710
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:29.900 --> 35:32.120
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:32.370 --> 35:37.890
♪No one can escape from love♪

35:53.670 --> 35:57.420
♪How many hidden feelings♪

35:57.740 --> 36:00.930
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:03.030 --> 36:06.800
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:07.070 --> 36:10.860
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:12.230 --> 36:15.250
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:15.470 --> 36:19.610
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:21.710 --> 36:25.830
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:25.920 --> 36:29.380
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

36:31.070 --> 36:34.670
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:34.690 --> 36:39.930
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:40.580 --> 36:44.140
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:44.190 --> 36:49.000
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:50.030 --> 36:53.300
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

36:53.450 --> 36:55.770
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:55.930 --> 36:59.260
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:59.460 --> 37:01.690
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:01.770 --> 37:07.310
♪No one can escape from love♪

